<title>CHINA: China Telecom says sees quick listing for Hong Kong.</title>
<headline>China Telecom says sees quick listing for Hong Kong.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Telecom is studying a listing for a Hong Kong subsidiary and a listing is expected in the near future, a company spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;China Telecom is studying a listing for China Telecom (Hong Kong),&quot; the spokesman said. &quot;I expect to see a listing in the near future.&quot;</p>
</text>
